<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Aug prod/import prices down 3.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss Aug prod/import prices down 3.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices fell 0.5 percent in August from the month before to stand 3.0 percent lower than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				    Aug 1996  July 1996   Aug 1995</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change    -0.5 pct  -0.2	  -0.2</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change	-3.0 pct  -2.6	  -0.5</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	 96.5	97.0	  99.4</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.  </p>
<p>The office also detailed the producer price index:</p>
<p>				    Aug 1996  July 1996   Aug 1995</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change   -0.5 pct  -0.1 pct    -0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change     -2.1 pct  -1.9 pct    -0.3 pct</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	97.2	97.6	  99.3</p>
<p>Import price index:</p>
<p>				    Aug 1996  July 1996   Aug 1995</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change   -0.8 pct  -0.5 pct    0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change     -4.9 pct  -4.2 pct    -1.1 pct</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	94.9	95.6	  99.8</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
